Dear Refilwe,

Welcome to the October 2026 edition of the Kloof Electrical customer newsletter.

Product news this month: we have added a new range of energy saving LED floodlights and outdoor sensor lights, as well as stock of standard circuit breakers and weatherproof isolators for home and site use. Pop into our shop to view the display and chat to our team about the right size for your needs.

Seasonal tip: With summer storms on the way, it is a good time to check outdoor wiring, plugs and extension leads for cracks and water damage, and to make sure outside lights are secure.

Thank you for supporting Mzansi Plumbing customers and our local community. We appreciate your custom.

Kind regards,
Sipho Ndlovu
Kloof Electrical

